# Testing & Quality

## Coverage
- Unit test + integration test for every feature
- Storybook snapshots for reusable components
- E2E tests (Playwright/Cypress) in `/tests/e2e/` for critical flows

## Build & Test Verification
- Verify build succeeds after every change
- Run full test suite after every change
- Fix failures immediately
- Never leave broken tests
